{"id": "DerYmiHREQ8", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "What did Maa Yashoda see inside baby Krishna's mouth? 🌌 Every mom says \"open your mouth!\" Only ONE saw the universe.\n\nOne day in Gokul, little Kanha ate mud. His big brother Balarama and the cowherd boys ran to tell Maa. Yashoda caught his hand: \"Did you eat mud?\" Kanha's eyes went wide: \"No Maa! They're all lying. Don't believe me? Look in my mouth!\"\n\nSo she said, \"Open.\" And inside her baby's mouth she saw everything: the sun, the moon and the stars, the oceans and mountains, the whole earth, Gokul itself… and HERSELF, looking in. She bowed to the Lord who was hiding inside her own little boy.\n\nThen Krishna let her forget it all, so she could simply be his Maa again. She scooped him up, and loved him even more. (Bhagavata Purana 10.8)\n\n📚 Want more stories like this for your little ones? Rishi Katha picture books: Books 1–3, set of 3 for ₹500 at rishikatha.com (link in bio).\n\n💬 What did YOUR mom catch YOU eating as a kid? Tell us below 👇\n❤️ Save this for bedtime and share it with your mom.\n➡️ Follow @therishikatha: Part 2 of Little Kanha is the rope that was ALWAYS two fingers too short.\n\n#krishna #balkrishna #kanha #yashoda #krishnaleela #littlekrishna #bhagavatam #harekrishna #janmashtami #gokul #vrindavan #indianmythology #storiesforkids #hindumythology #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792417258, "like_count": 23742, "comment_count": 163, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2318053705399844a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 46.134, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOHtL1GoUCDKVLOjj0T4tFr7K-nEddANDeH_I7VU-MunCa-UgYpeUC561C83FQYgx2kJSee0pC62XvSf5npnZNSvLXs0pbGdFt6z1Y.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdrknttrZ9kwqib3v5DPf